        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Pair locks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Every operation&lt;/b&gt; on a client pair (new share, stored share, operator delete) locks the pair on both SAEs: the lower SAE ID first, then the higher. A refusal releases the first lock; nobody waits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lease&lt;/b&gt;: in memory, 5 min, random token and issuing SAE; renewed every 60 s and before and after each commit step.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fencing&lt;/b&gt;: every write and delete checks in one transaction that the lease is still held. A lost lock aborts the operation and closes the device session.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Release&lt;/b&gt;: remote first.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stored share&lt;/b&gt;: one state, keys available, with the lock token, the issuer and the counterpart SAE.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;RMI&lt;/b&gt;: mutual TLS with pinned peers; the caller is identified by its certificate." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="520" x="20" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sync" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;" value="Stored share for this pair?" vertex="1">
